sqrt{\\frac{2eEh}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。电子带负电 "},{"type":"math","value":"-e"},{"type":"text","value":"，在竖直向下的匀强电场中所受电场力竖直向上，加速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{eE}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"。竖直向上射出的电子最早到达挡板（满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = v_0 t_{\\min} + \\frac{1}{2}at_{\\min}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"）；竖直向下射出的电子先向下减速再返回 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 点（往返耗时 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2v_0}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，回到 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时速度竖直向上且大小仍为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"），随后最晚到达挡板，故最大时间差 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_{\\max} = t_{\\max} - t_{\\min} = \\frac{2v_0}{a} = \\frac{2mv_0}{eE}"},{"type":"text","value":"。结合 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_{\\max} = 2\\sqrt{\\frac{2mh}{eE}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = \\sqrt{\\frac{2eEh}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n（4）按题干文字（磁场垂直纸面向里）："},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = \\frac{d}{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{eE}{2mh}} - \\frac{2E}{3B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（需满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"d > \\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mEh}{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":"）。电子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平向右射出，在电场中做类平抛运动，第 1 次穿过虚线用时 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_1 = \\sqrt{\\frac{2mh}{eE}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，水平位移 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_1 = v_0 t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，竖直向上分速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_y = at_1 = \\sqrt{\\frac{2eEh}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，设进入磁场时速率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"、速度与虚线向右方向夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta = \\frac{v_y}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"）。进入垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场后，负电子受洛伦兹力顺时针偏转圆心角 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 后第 2 次穿过虚线，沿虚线向右跨过的弦长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_B = 2R\\sin\\theta = 2\\frac{mv}{eB}\\sin\\theta = \\frac{2mv_y}{eB} = \\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mEh}{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，并以水平分速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"+v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"、竖直分速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"-v_y"},{"type":"text","value":" 重新射入下方电场；在电场中经时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = \\frac{2v_y}{a} = 2t_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 第 3 次到达虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，水平再向右前进 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_2 = 2v_0 t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"。由 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_1 + \\Delta x_B + x_2 = d"},{"type":"text","value":" 得 "},{"type":"math","value":"3v_0\\sqrt{\\frac{2mh}{eE}} + \\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mEh}{e}} = d"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = \\frac{d}{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{eE}{2mh}} - \\frac{2E}{3B}"},{"type":"text","value":"。（附注：若按原卷配图所画点状“垂直纸面向外”磁场计算，电子在磁场中逆时针转过优弧 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\pi - 2\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 向左跨过弦长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_B"},{"type":"text","value":"，再向右经电场到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，由 "},{"type":"math","value":"3v_0\\sqrt{\\frac{2mh}{eE}} - \\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mEh}{e}} = d"},{"type":"text","value":" 解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = \\frac{d}{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{eE}{2mh}} + \\frac{2E}{3B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，对任意 "},{"type":"math","value":"d > 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 均成立。）"}]}}]}
